<title>USA: Southern Pacific holders to get Union Pacific shrs.</title>
<headline>Southern Pacific holders to get Union Pacific shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BETHLEHEM, Pa 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of more than 60 percent of Southern Pacific Rail Corp will receive an interest in Union Pacific Corp after Southern merges with a Union subsidiary, Union said Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The railroad company said all Southern stock elections will be exchanged for Union common stock and cash.</p>
<p>It said the merger is expected to come into effect September 11.</p>
</text>
